  "id": "section-286",
  "title": "不要片面讲丰衣足食",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/2-135.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>134）</b>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　不过不要片面讲丰衣足食。讲丰衣足食，还得讲艰苦奋斗，没有艰苦奋斗，哪有丰衣足食？丰食足食是不能从天上掉下来的！<br>\n<br>\n　　自力更生，发展生产，它比任何“饷”，任何援助都可靠。<br>\n<br>\n<p>　　（转摘自《难忘的教诲》《福建日报》一九六一年七月二十九日）</p>\n<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/2-134.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/2-136.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
